{
 "name": "reindeer_costume",
 "description": "Doug's homemade reindeer suit (worn prop, anchor = Doug's hips, list after Doug at the same x/y/scale, flip when he faces left). Grey-brown felt #8a7a66 body suit with darker back, fur ticks, zipper, pale cream fringed neck bib, short sleeves ending in dark split hoof mitts at about (+-106,+20), a little white tail at the back. Felt hood is a C round the back of the head and under the chin (face fully visible), and two branched cardboard-brown antlers rise from both temples and spread up and out (tips about (+-260,-470)); the red cap sits on top between and above the antler bases. Pose: stand. No text.",
